# H2O MP2/6-31G geometry optimization (deliberately slightly distorted)
%method MP2
%basis  6-31G
%frozen_core 0        # keep legacy reference values; see run_mp2grad_tests.sh comment
%job    optimize
%charge 0
%mult   1
%geom_maxiter 15

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.100000
H   0.000000   0.780000  -0.450000
H   0.000000  -0.780000  -0.450000
*end
